## 🔧 Assignment Goal

> *Create a Salesforce Account record using Apex and Visualforce.*

We are doing this by:
1. Writing an *Apex class* (CreateAccount)
2. Creating a *Visualforce Page* that connects to it
3. Using input fields to collect details (name, phone, website, industry)
4. Saving the new Account to Salesforce

